    <item rdf:about="http://16.176.2.91/doku.php?id=case_studies&amp;rev=1779697227&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2026-05-25T08:20:27+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>case_studies</title>
        <link>http://16.176.2.91/doku.php?id=case_studies&amp;rev=1779697227&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>This section contains practical case studies, assignments, and applied learning activities related to Indigenous data governance, cyber security, digital ethics, technology policy, and Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander knowledge systems.

These case studies demonstrate how Indigenous perspectives, ethical frameworks, and digital governance principles can be applied in real-world educational, organisational, and research contexts.</description>
    </item>
