    <item rdf:about="http://16.176.2.91/doku.php?id=water_lightning_rain_dreaming_by_long_jack_phillipus&amp;rev=1774002384&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2026-03-20T10:26:24+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>water_lightning_rain_dreaming_by_long_jack_phillipus</title>
        <link>http://16.176.2.91/doku.php?id=water_lightning_rain_dreaming_by_long_jack_phillipus&amp;rev=1774002384&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Water &amp; Lightning Rain Dreaming by Long Jack Phillipus

“Water &amp; Lightning Rain Dreaming” by Long Jack Phillipus illustrates the powerful elements of water and lightning central to Aboriginal lore. This piece symbolizes rainstorms, rivers, and the life-giving forces they bring to the land, vital for survival in desert regions. Through vibrant patterns and colors, the artwork reflects the sacred connection to these natural elements, emphasizing their role in sustaining and renewing the earth.</description>
    </item>
</rdf:RDF>
